5.1 The Company implemented SLSL Employee Stock Option Scheme 2020 ("ESOP") for eligible employees, 1,33,200 stock options were granted on May 13,2026 by the Nomination &amp; Remuneration Committee. &lt;br /&gt; 
5.2 ESOP: for the quarter ended June 30, 2026, the Company has recognized an employee benefit expense (EBP) of Rs. 145.54 lakhs in accordance with Ind AS 102 – Share-based Payment. &lt;br /&gt; 
5.3 During the quarter ended June 30, 2026, the Company has allotted 2,71,970 equity shares of Rs.1 each, pursuant to the exercise of stock options by the employees of the company under Employee Stock Options  Scheme 2020. &lt;br /&gt; 
6. Preferential Issue:  The Board of Directors of the Company has approved the issue of 6,40,02,999 convertible warrants on a preferential basis to 23 allottees in its meeting held on 13th May, 2025, in accordance with the provisions of the Companies Act, 2013 and the SEBI (Issue of Capital and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2018. Subsequently, shareholders of the Company approved the issue of convertible warrants in their meeting held on 05th June, 2025. &lt;br /&gt; 
Each warrant is convertible into one equity share of face value Rs.1 at an exercise price of Rs.134 per share, within a period of 18 months from the date of allotment. &lt;br /&gt; 
As on 30 June 2026, the company has received the entire amount of Rs.85,764.02 lakhs from the warrant holders, out of which an amount of Rs.9,331.49 lakhs was received during the quarter in respect of 1,85,70,133 warrants, for which allotment is pending as on reporting date. &lt;br /&gt; 
